# Independent audit success criteria

Bind the exact k603 target in both designated original primary sources, including their definitions and table notes. Determine whether the elliptical-caustic restriction is source faithful, whether antipedal vertices use the intersections of consecutive perpendicular supporting objects and ordinary Euclidean focal distances, and whether all parity classes, oriented star orbits, self-intersections and repeated traversals are covered. Test omitted degeneracy/components rather than assuming the proof restriction is legitimate. Distinguish a source/scope conclusion from full proof correctness, priority, current open status, or publication permission. Preserve originals; write only this audit folder; no Git/native/service mutations or external contact.
